<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hi&nbsp;{!Lead.FirstName},<br><br>I'm writing to follow up on my email and voicemail. We are in the process of closing files this month. Typically when I haven't heard back from someone it means they are either really busy or not interested. If you aren't interested do I have permission to close your file?<br><br>If you are still interested, what do you recommend as a next step? Would you be interested in scheduling a call to discuss the opportunity?<br><br>Thanks for your help.<br><br>Best Regards,<br><br>Ben<div><img width="420" data-cke-saved-src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fi-LvmCPc1FD5qVWvWfrNoRO4OAiBv25_uWmcO7xwevrKELZPSjGC1sZXXSf6mwwiMNek6vo6IfH8RgtyVdvlbKj_735C655NWf7rozMbQLUtg0lA290uVTUhAwwAseeaN9Upynq3iZTsz0o9MDXSF4ClHAlw1n-B4lYRBII15WHSrFQ2X-OG_b4Md1E0oW9i8dBNOytwB6FYOeqeg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1dmYHwbBZppSiVLTErHMsgORMSrHoT9sU&amp;revid=0B09QfomT_h2yclNneTZHT2ZMQUdzU09qZ2VvTCt1K1F0Unc0PQ" src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fi-LvmCPc1FD5qVWvWfrNoRO4OAiBv25_uWmcO7xwevrKELZPSjGC1sZXXSf6mwwiMNek6vo6IfH8RgtyVdvlbKj_735C655NWf7rozMbQLUtg0lA290uVTUhAwwAseeaN9Upynq3iZTsz0o9MDXSF4ClHAlw1n-B4lYRBII15WHSrFQ2X-OG_b4Md1E0oW9i8dBNOytwB6FYOeqeg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1dmYHwbBZppSiVLTErHMsgORMSrHoT9sU&amp;revid=0B09QfomT_h2yclNneTZHT2ZMQUdzU09qZ2VvTCt1K1F0Unc0PQ" height="256"></div>]]></td>
